{
  "bodyHash": "bed081cceaf6ff01",
  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">理论上，此模组支持<strong>所有</strong>&nbsp;模组加载器！</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">简介</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">在 1.19 及更高版本的 Minecraft 中，若不存在现有存档，点击“单人游戏”按钮时，Minecraft 将<strong>自动打开“创建新世界”界面</strong>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">如果加载了大量模组，上述过程可能会非常缓慢，导致误触该按钮的用户不得不等待数秒。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">此模组让 Minecraft 能够在没有现有存档的情况下<strong>显示空白的世界选择列表界面</strong>，就像 1.19 之前的版本一样。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">效果展示</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">当你在没有任何存档的情况下点击“单人游戏”时：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">未安装此模组时：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/743/151/2023-10-14_23.png\" width=\"400\" height=\"209\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">安装此模组后：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/743/152/2023-10-14_23.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"225\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">注意</span></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">你<span style=\"color:#9c0\"><strong>绝对可以</strong></span>将此模组添加到你的模组包中；</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">本项目遵循&nbsp;<strong>Nova Relay License 1.0</strong> 协议。</span></li>\n</ul>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
